arm64: dts: mediatek: add independent BPI-R4 Pro 4E topology

Use the shared PCB storage/peripheral wiring, but the 4E network population.
No 8X include, AS21 PHY, PHY reset sequence or switch reprobe is introduced.
Both WAN paths start disabled; one step-4 overlay attaches the selected PHY
or SFP cage. Source checks are not hardware evidence.
See ../NETWORK-TOPOLOGY.md for schematic and upstream numbering references.

